  "description": "<p>Currently when you do a read action it generates a staging directory. All staging directories for ObjectSessions use the ID from the PersistentStorageSession, so they are all the same directory.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/OCFLPersistentStorageSession.java#L190\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/OCFLPersistentStorageSession.java#L190</a></p>\n\n<p>Later when you try to commit the transaction, these read action ObjectSessions are checked for changes and the fact that the files added for the other ObjectSessions are in the expected directory means they get committed to the wrong location.</p>",
